    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17544" root="زحل" body-key="z">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازحلهُ</span></b>  <i>He removed him,</i> or <i>it, far away;</i> as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زحّلهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَزْحِيلٌ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازحلهُ إِلَيْهِ</span>
(tropical:)  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, constrained him to betake himself,</i> or
<i>repair,</i> or <i>have recourse, to him,</i> or <i>it.</i> (K, TA.)

